sequenceDiagram
    title UC4 — Skill Certificate Verification — Full Flow
    participant RNP as Staffing Platform (Requesting NP)
    participant GW as Beckn Gateway
    participant PNP as Cert Verifier (Provider NP)

    Note over RNP,PNP: Discovery
    RNP->>GW: discover<br/>verificationType = SKILL_CERTIFICATE
    GW->>PNP: discover
    PNP-->>GW: on_discover<br/>resources[Skill Cert Verification]<br/>offers[₹30/req, PT1H SLA]
    GW-->>RNP: on_discover

    Note over RNP,PNP: Selection
    RNP->>GW: select (commitment → Resource + Offer)
    GW->>PNP: select
    PNP-->>GW: on_select (consideration: ₹30)
    GW-->>RNP: on_select

    Note over RNP,PNP: Initialisation
    RNP->>GW: init<br/>subject: Ankit Patel<br/>cert: ITI-GJ-2020-45678<br/>issuer: NCVT<br/>consent: OTP<br/>purpose: PLATFORM_ONBOARDING
    GW->>PNP: init
    PNP-->>GW: on_init
    GW-->>RNP: on_init

    Note over RNP,PNP: Confirmation
    RNP->>GW: confirm (contract ACTIVE)
    GW->>PNP: confirm
    PNP-->>GW: on_confirm (performance PENDING)
    GW-->>RNP: on_confirm

    Note over RNP,PNP: Result
    Note right of PNP: Queries NCVT registry<br/>Validates cert number,<br/>trade, institute, validity
    RNP->>GW: status
    GW->>PNP: status
    PNP-->>GW: on_status<br/>VERIFIED<br/>tradeName: Electrician<br/>issuingInstitute: ITI Ahmedabad<br/>validUntil: 2030-12-31
    GW-->>RNP: on_status
